 ],
 "captions": [
  {
   "text": "Last time\u2026 Milo stayed",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 1.97,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "behind the red door.",
   "start": 1.97,
   "end": 3.487,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "And the admin said\u2026",
   "start": 3.487,
   "end": 4.929,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Welcome back, Juno.",
   "start": 5.129,
   "end": 7.747,
   "spk": "AK"
  },
  {
   "text": "Juno ran.",
   "start": 8.247,
   "end": 9.463,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "But the admin didn't",
   "start": 9.763,
   "end": 11.312,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "chase her. He just\u2026",
   "start": 11.312,
   "end": 12.784,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "smiled.",
   "start": 12.784,
   "end": 13.326,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "She ran back to",
   "start": 13.926,
   "end": 15.057,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "the red door. But",
   "start": 15.057,
   "end": 16.34,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "now\u2026 it was chained",
   "start": 16.34,
   "end": 17.773,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "shut.",
   "start": 17.773,
   "end": 18.15,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Milo! Can you hear",
   "start": 18.45,
   "end": 20.205,
   "spk": "J"
  },
  {
   "text": "me?",
   "start": 20.205,
   "end": 20.498,
   "spk": "J"
  },
  {
   "text": "Juno! The admin's crown\u2026",
   "start": 21.598,
   "end": 23.05,
   "spk": "MF"
  },
  {
   "text": "it's the key! It",
   "start": 23.05,
   "end": 24.018,
   "spk": "MF"
  },
  {
   "text": "opens the door!",
   "start": 24.018,
   "end": 24.926,
   "spk": "MF"
  },
  {
   "text": "Then his voice was",
   "start": 25.326,
   "end": 27.129,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "gone.",
   "start": 27.129,
   "end": 27.63,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "He took Milo. He",
   "start": 28.33,
   "end": 30.109,
   "spk": "J"
  },
  {
   "text": "took all of them.",
   "start": 30.109,
   "end": 31.999,
   "spk": "J"
  },
  {
   "text": "They're not gone. They're",
   "start": 32.299,
   "end": 34.551,
   "spk": "J"
  },
  {
   "text": "trapped. And I need",
   "start": 34.551,
   "end": 36.263,
   "spk": "J"
  },
  {
   "text": "your help.",
   "start": 36.263,
   "end": 37.163,
   "spk": "J"
  },
  {
   "text": "One by one\u2026 the",
   "start": 37.563,
   "end": 38.68,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "other players stepped forward.",
   "start": 38.68,
   "end": 40.913,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "The plan was simple.",
   "start": 41.613,
   "end": 43.575,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Hey, admin! Over here!",
   "start": 43.775,
   "end": 45.738,
   "spk": "P"
  },
  {
   "text": "While everyone distracted him\u2026",
   "start": 46.038,
   "end": 48.555,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Juno grabbed the crown.",
   "start": 48.755,
   "end": 51.145,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "And without his crown\u2026",
   "start": 52.045,
   "end": 53.781,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "the admin changed.",
   "start": 53.781,
   "end": 55.202,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "You should not have",
   "start": 56.102,
   "end": 57.893,
   "spk": "K"
  },
  {
   "text": "done that.",
   "start": 57.893,
   "end": 58.835,
   "spk": "K"
  },
  {
   "text": "Juno pressed the crown",
   "start": 59.535,
   "end": 61.28,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "against the door.",
   "start": 61.28,
   "end": 62.628,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "The chains shattered.",
   "start": 63.828,
   "end": 65.748,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "And out of the",
   "start": 67.548,
   "end": 68.625,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "red light\u2026 stepped Milo.",
   "start": 68.625,
   "end": 70.471,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Juno! You came back!",
   "start": 70.771,
   "end": 71.944,
   "spk": "M"
  },
  {
   "text": "I'd never leave you",
   "start": 72.244,
   "end": 73.834,
   "spk": "J"
  },
  {
   "text": "behind.",
   "start": 73.834,
   "end": 74.42,
   "spk": "J"
  },
  {
   "text": "And he wasn't alone.",
   "start": 76.02,
   "end": 77.599,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Every player who had",
   "start": 77.899,
   "end": 79.441,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "ever vanished\u2026 was free.",
   "start": 79.441,
   "end": 81.291,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Someone\u2026 must\u2026 stay!",
   "start": 82.591,
   "end": 85.74,
   "spk": "K"
  },
  {
   "text": "Not this time.",
   "start": 86.04,
   "end": 87.448,
   "spk": "J"
  },
  {
   "text": "Together, they pushed the",
   "start": 87.848,
   "end": 89.481,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Keeper through the door.",
   "start": 89.481,
   "end": 91.048,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "The door slammed shut.",
   "start": 92.948,
   "end": 94.539,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "And on a new",
   "start": 94.539,
   "end": 95.407,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "sign\u2026 a new rule",
   "start": 95.407,
   "end": 96.564,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "appeared.",
   "start": 96.564,
   "end": 97.215,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Everything was finally okay.",
   "start": 100.515,
   "end": 103.224,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Or\u2026 was it?",
   "start": 105.624,
   "end": 106.989,
   "spk": "N"
  }
 ],
